        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 6001S, Stainless Steel Voyager Square Privacy Bolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Square Voyager Stainless Steel Privacy Bolt is typically used on bedroom or bathroom doors. It is a stylish and modern way to add a privacy lock to interior doors. It features a square rose and stainless steel construction for the most contemporary of spaces. The Stainless Steel Voyager Square Privacy Bolt has a brushed stainless steel finish. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Privacy Bolt (Bathroom and Bedroom):</b> Locks but has access to unlock from the outside via emergency turn. Privacy locks do not offer security, they offer privacy. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia 6001S Privacy Door Bolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Rose Length (both interior and exterior): 2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Faceplate Height: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Faceplate Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Height: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" - 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Package Includes: faceplate, strike, dustbox, interior rose with turnpiece, and emergency release exterior rose.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Will not cover a 2-1/8\" pre-drilled door borehole.</i>\r\n</p>",
